<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-beishi" book-id="b-beishi-072" chapter-id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong" source-id="s-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong-ws1153541">
  <p id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">九年，<persName id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0003" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">晉王廣</persName>大舉伐陳，以熲為無帥長史，三軍皆取斷於熲。及陳平，晉王欲納陳主寵姬<persName id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0039" ref="3jv_fyp_o96">張麗華</persName>。熲曰：「<persName id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0047" ref="y4i_pjk_4gn_AA">武王</persName>滅殷，戮<persName id="c-beishi-072-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0053" ref="42a_nv5_urq">妲己</persName>。今平陳國，不宜取麗華。」乃命斬之。王甚不悅。</p>
</text>
